    <string name="einfuhr_anleitung_keep">Google Keep: open takeout.google.com on the phone, select only “Keep”, request the export and save the .zip here.</string>
    <string name="einfuhr_anleitung_samsung">Samsung Notes: open the list, tap and hold a note, choose More → Save as file → PDF or text, then import the folder here. A whole notebook can be selected at once.</string>
